    {
      "input": "P 只能推 Q 不能拉 Q，所以分离的临界条件是两者之间的接触力 N=0。",
      "idle_time": 8,
      "note": "给出分离条件（关键节点 S3）",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S3"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "分离前对 Q 用牛顿第二定律：N = m2·a；分离时 N=0，所以 a=0。",
      "idle_time": 7,
      "note": "单独分析 Q",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S4"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "共同运动阶段 a = -kx/(m1+m2)，由 a=0 得 x=0，即弹簧恢复原长时分离。",
      "idle_time": 9,
      "note": "定出分离位置（关键节点 S5）",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S5"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "用能量守恒：1/2·k·d² = 1/2·(m1+m2)·v²，得 v = d·√(k/(m1+m2))。",
      "idle_time": 12,
      "note": "能量法求分离速度（S6a）",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S6a", "S7"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "分离后 Q 不受水平力做匀速运动，振子系统只剩弹簧和 P，系统边界变了。",
      "idle_time": 10,
      "note": "识别分离后的新系统（关键节点 S8）",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S8"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "分离瞬间 P 在弹簧原长处，所以 x0=0，速度还是 v。",
      "idle_time": 8,
      "note": "确定 P 的新初始条件",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S9"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
    },
    {
      "input": "由 1/2·k·A² = 1/2·m1·v²，得 A = d·√(m1/(m1+m2))。",
      "idle_time": 14,
      "note": "求 P 的新振幅",
      "expected": {"nodes": ["S10"], "error": false, "complete": false, "hint_level": 0}
